Detector details:
```
def strip_brackets(s): remove [ ... ] spans (non-greedy, dotall)
def chain_symbols(sentence): 
    if ' contains ' in sentence: parts = sentence.split(' contains '); order = parts (largest→smallest)
    elif ' subset of ' in sentence: parts = sentence.split(' subset of '); order = parts (smallest→largest) -> rank reversed
    tokens per part: re.findall(r'E_\{[^}]*\}|E_[A-Za-z0-9]+', part)
    derive token→size index from largest (0) to smallest
```
For F2b: order = [E_C0, E_H2loc, E_{C^1,1}, E_C2] (largest→smallest) — rank E_C2 = 3.
